<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS2.SSS7" title="In A.2 Risk of the attention layer on population loss ‣ Appendix A Population risk ‣ Statistical Advantage of Softmax Attention: Insights from Single-Location Regression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.2.7 </span>Minimizer for the linear attention</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS2.SSS8" title="In A.2 Risk of the attention layer on population loss ‣ Appendix A Population risk ‣ Statistical Advantage of Softmax Attention: Insights from Single-Location Regression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.2.8 </span>Proof of corollary <span class="ltx_ref"></span>: asymptotic convergence rates</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
