<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS2.SSS8.Px2" title="In A.2.8 Proof of corollary : asymptotic convergence rates ‣ A.2 Risk of the attention layer on population loss ‣ Appendix A Population risk ‣ Statistical Advantage of Softmax Attention: Insights from Single-Location Regression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Max-SLR at <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nu=\infty" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nu=\infty</annotation></semantics></math> for growing lengths <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>L</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
