<p id="A3.SS2.p3.4" class="ltx_p">with <math id="A3.SS2.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varsigma\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ς</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varsigma\sim\mathcal{N}(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math> and the partition functions</p>
